          "relevance": 0.0,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Workspace owners and billing admins manage billing under Settings, then Billing. Fernway charges per member: every member counts as a seat, guests do not."
        },
        {
          "token_budget": null,
          "variants": [],
          "conflict_policy": "defers",
          "eligibility": "route-policy",
          "id": "help:billing@5#1",
          "slot": "evidence.knowledge",
          "source": "help-center:billing",
          "source_version": "5",
          "authority": "reference_only",
          "trust": "verified",
          "freshness": "2026-07-14T12:00:00Z",
          "relevance": 0.0,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Fernway accepts Visa, Mastercard and American Express cards. Business workspaces on annual billing can also pay by invoice with 30-day payment terms; contact sales to switch."
        },
        {
          "token_budget": null,
          "variants": [],
          "conflict_policy": "defers",
          "eligibility": "route-policy",
          "id": "help:billing@5#2",
          "slot": "evidence.knowledge",
          "source": "help-center:billing",
          "source_version": "5",
          "authority": "reference_only",
          "trust": "verified",
          "freshness": "2026-07-14T12:00:00Z",
          "relevance": 0.0,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Invoices are emailed to the billing contact on every charge and are listed under Billing, then Invoices, as PDF downloads. To add a VAT or tax ID, edit Billing details; it appears on every invoice issued after the change."
        },
        {
          "token_budget": null,
          "variants": [],
          "conflict_policy": "defers",
          "eligibility": "route-policy",
          "id": "help:billing@5#3",
